WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.968
Anika: Graceful degradation removes recommendations, not order confirmation.

2
00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:09.169
Hannah: What does the customer see during payment uncertainty?

3
00:00:09.169 --> 00:00:13.993
Anika: Pending status. Never a fabricated success message.

4
00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:17.738
Lukas: Does cached content remain tenant-safe and fresh?

5
00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:23.522
Raj: Public recommendations only. Personalized responses aren't shared.

6
00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:27.506
Priya: Just to confirm, critical path intact, right?

7
00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:33.387
Hannah: Maybe. Test confirmation when recommendations are unavailable.

8
00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:37.083
Raj: That'll buy us time without hiding payment errors.

9
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:41.548
Lukas: Okay, define the rollback trigger using business outcomes.

10
00:00:41.548 --> 00:00:46.180
Priya: New recommendation designs? Let's park that today.

